{
  "id": "p21",
  "title": "The Night at the Mountain Laboratory",
  "titleZh": "山间实验室的一夜",
  "topic": "山间救助",
  "paragraphs": [
    [
      {
        "en": "My cousin and neighbour work in a small laboratory on the mountain.",
        "zh": "我的表亲和邻居在山上一间小实验室里工作。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My cousin studies natural medicine and knows every wild plant nearby.",
        "zh": "我的表亲研究天然药物，认识附近每一种野生植物。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then a strict storm sweeps through the valley late at night.",
        "zh": "然后一场猛烈的暴风雨在深夜横扫山谷。"
      },
      {
        "en": "An airline passenger knocks on the door and calls for help.",
        "zh": "一位航空公司乘客敲门并呼救。"
      },
      {
        "en": "He reached the gate at eleven with a wet coat.",
        "zh": "他在十一点到达大门，身上穿着湿外套。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My cousin gives the lost man a warm seat by the fire.",
        "zh": "我的表亲让这个迷路的男人在火边坐下。"
      },
      {
        "en": "She tries to find a clean room and dry clothes for him.",
        "zh": "她设法找一间干净的房间和干衣服给他。"
      },
      {
        "en": "He walked from the old bus stop into the heavy evening rain.",
        "zh": "他从旧公交站走进傍晚的大雨中。"
      },
      {
        "en": "I think he hides the truth about his long walk up here.",
        "zh": "我认为他隐瞒了关于长途跋涉的真相。"
      },
      {
        "en": "She asks where he slept outside on such cold and windy nights.",
        "zh": "她问他在这么寒冷多风的夜里睡在哪儿。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "At the end of the long line, a small lamp shines.",
        "zh": "在长队的尽头，一盏小灯亮着。"
      },
      {
        "en": "It is important that he accepts a warm drink and sits down.",
        "zh": "重要的是他先接受一杯热饮并坐下。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Her simple treatment will keep him healthy for the whole night.",
        "zh": "她简单的治疗会让他整夜保持健康。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Real care must prove stronger than any quick and easy words.",
        "zh": "真正的关怀必须证明比任何轻巧的话更有力。"
      },
      {
        "en": "He does not cry, but the cold feels close to death tonight.",
        "zh": "他没有哭，但寒冷让他觉得接近死亡。"
      },
      {
        "en": "She keeps in mind that he is homeless and still very proud.",
        "zh": "她记得他无家可归，但依然非常自尊。"
      },
      {
        "en": "She will not forget to say sorry for her sharp tone earlier.",
        "zh": "她不会忘记为之前尖锐的语气道歉。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Her small camera shows the whole scene on a cracked screen.",
        "zh": "她的小相机在破裂的屏幕上显示整个场景。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Judges score each photo, and her best picture may win.",
        "zh": "评委给每张照片打分，她最好的照片可能获胜。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The club president calls her a true master of soft light.",
        "zh": "俱乐部主席称她为柔光的大师。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "A group of active members walks up the hill before sunrise.",
        "zh": "一群活跃的成员在日出前爬上山丘。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A fixed underground cellar lies beneath the old stone church.",
        "zh": "一间固定的地下酒窖位于老石教堂下面。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A rock and a long stick block the narrow wooden door.",
        "zh": "一块石头和一根长棍挡住那扇窄木门。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Cold air flies above the wide door and the empty yard.",
        "zh": "冷空气从那扇宽门和空院子上方飞过。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then their usual dialogue fills the dark and empty space.",
        "zh": "然后他们平常的对话填满黑暗空荡的空间。"
      },
      {
        "en": "In general, she wishes more people would help on such nights.",
        "zh": "总的来说，她希望有更多人在这样的夜里帮忙。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Later, for a moment, the place feels rather like a warm home.",
        "zh": "后来，有一刻，这地方感觉更像一个温暖的家。"
      },
      {
        "en": "She writes his name on the list, ready for more hard work.",
        "zh": "她把他的名字写在名单上，准备做更多艰苦的工作。"
      }
    ]
  ],
